{"Both UpdateCompatibilityCheck and UpdateCompatibilityMetadata contain identical feature-checking boilerplate at the start of their run() methods (checking if ROLLING_UPDATES is enabled, calling printFeatureDisabled(), exiting with FEATURE_DISABLED, followed by printPreviewWarning() and validateConfig()). This shared logic could be extracted to a protected method in the base class AbstractUpdatesCommand to eliminate duplication.": 0.1142638698220253}